					</region>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">При температуре 550 К (синяя линия)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Скорость газа при диаметре 2<sp count="2"/>- <region region-id="1496" left="549.75" top="2871.75" width="38.25" height="18" align-x="567.75" align-y="2880.75" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
						<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
